entries[239520] = { ["name"] = "Lightbreaker Bracers", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nWrist Plate\n477 Armor\n+14 Strength\n+23 Stamina\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Warrior\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\nEquip: Increases your attack speed by 1%.\nEquip: Increases the block value of your shield by 7.\nEquip: Increased Defense +11.\n\nLightbreaker's Battlegear (0/8)\nLightbreaker Helmet\nLightbreaker Pauldrons\nLightbreaker Breastplate\nLightbreaker Waistguard\nLightbreaker Legplates\nLightbreaker Sabatons\nLightbreaker Bracers\nLightbreaker Gauntlets\n(2) Set : Your Shockwave deals 60% increased damage and its cooldown is reduced by 2.0 sec each time you hit a target with Heroic Strike or Cleave.\n(4) Set : Your Recklessness, Retaliation, and Shield Wall abilities no longer share a cooldown. Additionally, your Recklessness ability lasts 15 sec longer, and while it is active you gain 50% of your Defense Skill over 300 as Strength.\n(6) Set : Your abilities no longer have stance requirements. In addition, hits from Revenge, Devastate, or Shield Slam increase the damage done by your next Whirlwind or Execute by 20%, stacking up to 5 times." }
