entries[239584] = { ["name"] = "Gloves of Revelation", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n91 Armor\n+13 Stamina\n+15 Intellect\n+14 Spirit\nDurability 35 / 35\nClasses: Priest\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 2%.\nEquip: Increases healing done by up to 73 and damage done by up to 25 for all magical spells and effects.\n\nVestments of Revelation (0/8)\nCirclet of Revelation\nShoulderpads of Revelation\nBelt of Revelation\nLeggings of Revelation\nSandals of Revelation\nBindings of Revelation\nGloves of Revelation\nRobe of Revelation\n(2) Set : Reduces the cooldown of Power Word: Barrier by 30 sec and Surge of Light now also makes Prayer of Healing and Greater Heal instant cast.\n(4) Set : Power Word: Shield casts instantly heal the target for 60% of the absorb value and Serendipity empowered spells have their healing increased by 10% per stack.\n(6) Set : Increases the healing of Circle of Healing and Penance by 25%. Additionally, the cooldown of your Spirit of the Redeemer is reduced by 30 sec and your healing is increased by 20% while your Spirit of the Redeemer is active." }
