entries[240044] = { ["name"] = "Fireleaf Wristwraps", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nWrist Cloth\n64 Armor\n+12 Stamina\n+12 Intellect\nDurability 35 / 35\nClasses: Mage\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Increases your casting speed by 1%.\nEquip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 28.\n\nFireleaf Vestments (0/8)\nFireleaf Hood\nFireleaf Mantle\nFireleaf Waistguard\nFireleaf Pants\nFireleaf Boots\nFireleaf Wristwraps\nFireleaf Mitts\nFireleaf Garb\n(2) Set : Your Arcane Blast has a 10% chance to cause Arcane Tunneling. Arcane Tunneling prevents your Arcane Blast effect from being consumed by the next other Arcane damage spell you cast. In addition, activating Arcane Power resets the cooldown on your Mass Regeneration. (Proc chance: 20%)\n(4) Set : Rewind Time also reduces all damage taken by your target by 20% for 8 sec.\n(6) Set : Reduces the cooldown of your Arcane Power by 90 sec and increases its duration by 10 sec. While Arcane Power is active, your chance to gain Arcane Tunneling is increased by 10% and each cast of Arcane Blast reduces the remaining cooldown on Mass Regeneration by 1.0 sec." }
