entries[240060] = { ["name"] = "Waywatcher Wraps", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nWrist Leather\n120 Armor\n+21 Strength\n+17 Agility\n+10 Stamina\n+10 Intellect\nDurability 40 / 40\nClasses: Druid\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\nEquip: +2 Weapon Damage.\n\nWaywatcher Ferocity (0/8)\nWaywatcher Cowl\nWaywatcher Shoulderpads\nWaywatcher Vest\nWaywatcher Sash\nWaywatcher Trousers\nWaywatcher Stompers\nWaywatcher Wraps\nWaywatcher Grips\n(2) Set : You gain 2 Energy each time Rake or Rip deals periodic damage.\n(4) Set : Multiplies the damage bonus from Tiger's Fury by 2.\n(6) Set : Your Finishing Moves have a 20% chance per combo point spent to trigger Clearcasting and extend the duration of your active Tiger's Fury by 6 sec." }
