entries[240128] = { ["name"] = "Soulcrusher Armor", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nChest Mail\n611 Armor\n+49 Strength\n+13 Stamina\n+14 Intellect\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 2%.\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 2%.\nEquip: Increases your attack speed by 2%.\n\nThe Soulcrusher's Rage (0/8)\nSoulcrusher Helmet\nSoulcrusher Epaulets\nSoulcrusher Armor\nSoulcrusher Belt\nSoulcrusher Leggings\nSoulcrusher Treads\nSoulcrusher Vambraces\nSoulcrusher Grips\n(2) Set : While Static Shock is active, Lava Lash, Lava Burst, and Stormstrike have a 100% chance to add a charge to your Lightning Shield. If charges exceed 9, Lightning Shield will immediately deal damage to your target instead of adding charges.\n(4) Set : Reduces the cooldown on your Fire Nova Totem by 60%, increases its damage by 200%, and reduces its mana cost by 60%. Additionally, your Fire Nova Totem now activates instantly on cast.\n(6) Set : Maelstrom Weapon can now stack up to 10 charges. When using a two-handed weapon, gain 2 charges at a time. Casts with over 5 charges increase that spell's damage or healing dealt by 20% per excess charge. Casts while at 10 charges will consume all charges and cast twice." }
