entries[240138] = { ["name"] = "Heretic Robe", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n146 Armor\n+12 Stamina\n+17 Intellect\n+25 Spirit\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warlock\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 2%.\nEquip: Increases your casting speed by 2%.\nEquip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 65.\n\nHeretic Raiment (0/8)\nHeretic Cowl\nHeretic Shoulderpads\nHeretic Belt\nHeretic Leggings\nHeretic Sandals\nHeretic Bindings\nHeretic Gloves\nHeretic Robe\n(2) Set : Your Shadow and Fire non-periodic critical strikes cause the target to Burn for 25% of the damage they deal over 4 sec.\n(4) Set : Your Shadow Bolt, Haunt, Chaos Bolt, Shadow Cleave, and Soul Fire deal 30% more damage to targets afflicted with your Corruption.\n(6) Set : Your periodic critical strikes grant 20% spellcasting haste for 15 sec, and your Backdraft grants an additional 12% spellcasting haste." }
