entries[240842] = { ["name"] = "Scarlet Rotbringer", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nTwo-Hand Staff\n157 - 236 Damage Speed 3.60\n(54.58 damage per second)\n150 Armor\n+24 Strength\n+14 Agility\n+48 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 2%.\nEquip: Increased Defense +7.\nEquip: Chance on melee attack to inflict your enemy with a rot, dealing 100 Nature damage every 2 sec to all enemies within an 8 yard radius of the caster for 12 sec. The attack speed of these targets is also slowed by 15%.\nEquip: +756 Attack Power in Cat, Bear, and Dire Bear forms only." }
